          "style": {
            "font-family": "Charter, \"Iowan Old Style\", \"New York\", Palatino, Georgia, serif",
            "font-weight": "700",
            "font-size": "108px",
            "line-height": "1",
            "letter-spacing": "-0.03em",
            "color": "#191918"
          },
          "morphId": null,
          "lineageId": "text-slide-ln6cror3-a50e-title",
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Agents.",
          "autoFit": true,
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle"
        },
        {
          "id": "text-vzbv8cx2-a50e",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 252,
          "w": 1680,
          "h": 542,
          "rot": 0,
          "z": 2,
          "opacity": 1,
          "class": [
            "role-body"
          ],
          "style": {
            "font-family": "\"Avenir Next\", Avenir, \"Helvetica Neue\", Inter, system-ui, sans-serif",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "font-size": "48px",
            "line-height": "1.32",
            "letter-spacing": "0",
            "color": "#191918"
          },
          "morphId": null,
          "lineageId": "text-slide-ln6cror3-a50e-body",
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<ul><li><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">Launch an agent in the directory of the deck, it has an AGENTS.md file that describes how the agent can author &amp; edit content.</span></li><li><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">Agents use native HTML to author slides that is then imported via DeckWerk's own HTML importer.</span><br></li><li>Priorities: (1) faithful to agent's HTML (2) editability.</li><li>Editability stays high, but most importantly, the agent can do what it does best: author HTML :)</li></ul>",
          "autoFit": true,
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top"
        },
        {
          "id": "text-f1bjolg8-a50e",
          "x": 157,
          "y": 822,
          "w": 1607,
          "h": 258,
          "rot": 0,
          "z": 3,
          "opacity": 1,
          "class": [
            "role-caption"
          ],
          "style": {
            "font-family": "\"Avenir Next\", Avenir, \"Helvetica Neue\", Inter, system-ui, sans-serif",
            "font-weight": "500",
            "font-size": "30px",
            "line-height": "1.3",
            "letter-spacing": "0.015em",
            "color": "#6b6862"
          },
          "morphId": null,
          "lineageId": "text-slide-ln6cror3-a50e-body",
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<p>Pls go to https://vsitzmann.github.io/plumage/, get images of 4 birds and their attribution, and build a slide with the same style as the existing slides with four round crops of the images (make sure that the crops are centered around the birds) as well as their scientific names and their attribution below. It should be interactive, the attribution and bird names should appear upon hover over the brid images. Insert after slide 8.</p><p><br></p>",
          "autoFit": true,
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top"
        }
      ],
      "timeline": []
    },
