            "color": "#191918"
          },
          "morphId": null,
          "lineageId": "text-slide-bjuw97zu-e65a-title",
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Open Source - Vibecode away :)",
          "autoFit": true,
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle"
        },
        {
          "id": "text-btfkon3h",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 252,
          "w": 1680,
          "h": 700,
          "rot": 0,
          "z": 2,
          "opacity": 1,
          "class": [
            "role-body"
          ],
          "style": {
            "font-family": "\"Avenir Next\", Avenir, \"Helvetica Neue\", Inter, system-ui, sans-serif",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "font-size": "48px",
            "line-height": "1.32",
            "letter-spacing": "0",
            "color": "#191918"
          },
          "morphId": null,
          "lineageId": "text-slide-bjuw97zu-e65a-body",
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<ul><li>Though literally all of this is vibecoded, it took me many many hours to make DeckWerk actually <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">work</span><span style=\"font-style: normal;\"> for what I need.</span></li><li>But what <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">I</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">need may not be what <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">you</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> need.</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">So, view this as your starting point to vibe-code away and change this into whatever you want it to be :) </span></span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I will maintain this repo such that is serves <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">my</span><span style=\"font-style: normal;\"> use case best, and alas, I don't have time to do maintain it for anyone but myself<span style=\"font-style: normal;\">. </span>This may deviate from your needs, in which case, please fork it and make it better!</span></span></span></p>",
          "autoFit": true,
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top"
        }
      ],
      "timeline": []
    },
